@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a new `CSVDocumentSplitter` component. It splits a CSV Document into multiple sub-tables
+    by detecting consecutive empty rows and/or columns that exceed the configured thresholds and
+    using them as delimiters. Row-only, column-only and recursive (rows then columns) splitting are
+    supported through the `row_split_threshold` and `column_split_threshold` parameters.
